00:35:02,830 --> 00:35:07,690
But they're also combining it
with AlphaZero-like technology.

608
00:35:07,690 --> 00:35:10,150
So they use Monte Carlo
tree search in this case.

609
00:35:10,150 --> 00:35:13,440
So they have Monte
Carlo tree search.

610
00:35:13,440 --> 00:35:14,470
Carlo tree search.

611
00:35:14,470 --> 00:35:18,700
So this is a reinforcement
learning problem.

612
00:35:18,700 --> 00:35:20,370
It's multi-step,
because the idea

613
00:35:20,370 --> 00:35:22,120
is that you want to
take a series of steps

614
00:35:22,120 --> 00:35:24,830
until you solve the
multiplication problem.

615
00:35:24,830 --> 00:35:26,920
And what the steps
are, in this case, is

616
00:35:26,920 --> 00:35:28,940
you could think of it as
like algorithmic steps.

617
00:35:28,940 --> 00:35:31,690
So like, which parts of your--

618
00:35:31,690 --> 00:35:33,410
if we go back to here.

