of correct algorithms?

640
00:36:23,260 --> 00:36:25,010
And so there's some
really nice properties

641
00:36:25,010 --> 00:36:27,540
for this particular problem
that allowed them to do that.

642
00:36:27,540 --> 00:36:29,910
Some other people had also
noticed this in the past.

643
00:36:29,910 --> 00:36:31,790
And then what they
said is, oh, given

644
00:36:31,790 --> 00:36:35,810
that we have that-- given
that we have a way to verify

645
00:36:35,810 --> 00:36:38,240
and only search in the
algorithms that are correct, now

646
00:36:38,240 --> 00:36:40,280
what we can do is just
optimize for length.

647
00:36:40,280 --> 00:36:42,290
And so the way that they
do that, in this case,

648
00:36:42,290 --> 00:36:43,730
