head and a value head.

654
00:36:56,330 --> 00:36:58,670
Similar to what we
saw for AlphaZero.

655
00:36:58,670 --> 00:37:01,340
But they are going to
do this forward search.

656
00:37:01,340 --> 00:37:03,560
Now, one of the interesting
things about this

657
00:37:03,560 --> 00:37:07,430
is that compared to what we
saw for AlphaGo, in AlphaGo--

658
00:37:07,430 --> 00:37:09,680
because I saw some of-- we
